    "notes": "Inspected all 12 views plus a full-size rear orbit to read the badge. Individually modelled keycaps with legends, trackball, floppy slot, screen bezel and a full rear I/O panel with parallel, serial and VGA ports. The underside shows a proper service-panel layout with vents. Yellowed beige plastic is convincingly period-correct.",
    "limitations": [
      "Lid badge reads SENNETZ MIKROPER, an invented brand rather than a real manufacturer; underside carries generic inventory labels.",
      "Screen is blank and the hinge is fixed at one open angle."
    ],
